    <briefdescription>
<para>Semantic validation layer for LLM-generated AQL queries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.1.0</para>
</simplesect>
Provides advanced semantic validation beyond syntax checking, including:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Type checking (attribute types vs. filter/projection operations)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Cardinality estimation (join selectivity, aggregation impacts)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Join order validation (circular dependencies, impossible joins)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Function signature validation (parameter type compatibility)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This validator operates on validated AQL ASTs (post-parser). </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/aql/AQL_ARCHITECTURE_MASTER.md (Section 8.2: Semantic Validation) </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
